          "text": "Aba bakapegwa milimo yakunjila muŋanda ya-Jehova muciyanza ncibakataanguna kubikilwa kujanza lya-Aroni wisaabo, mbubonya mbwaakamulailila Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli.",
